#: luci-app-tailscale-community/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/tailscale.js:562
msgid ""
"Tailscale is a mesh VPN solution that makes it easy to connect your "
"devices securely. This configuration page allows you to manage "
"Tailscale settings on your OpenWrt device."
msgstr ""
"Tailscale to rozwiązanie VPN mesh, które ułatwia bezpieczne łączenie "
"urządzeń. Ta strona konfiguracyjna pozwala zarządzać ustawieniami "
"Tailscale na urządzeniu OpenWrt."

#: luci-app-tailscale-community/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/tailscale.js:389
msgid "Tailscale status error"
msgstr "Błąd statusu Tailscale"

#: luci-app-tailscale-community/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/tailscale.js:647
msgid ""
"The Tailscale to WAN forwarding is what lets clients send their "
"internet traffic through this device as an Exit Node."
msgstr ""
"Przekazywanie z Tailscale do sieci WAN pozwala klientom wysyłać ruch "
"internetowy przez to urządzenie jako węzeł wyjścia."

#: luci-app-tailscale-community/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/tailscale.js:770
msgid "This can take up to 30 seconds."
msgstr "Może to potrwać do 30 sekund."

#: luci-app-tailscale-community/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/tailscale.js:800
msgid ""
"This will disconnect this device from your Tailnet and require you to "
"re-authenticate."
msgstr ""
"Spowoduje to rozłączenie tego urządzenia z Twojego Tailnet i wymaga "
"ponownego uwierzytelnienia."

#: luci-app-tailscale-community/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/tailscale.js:143
#: luci-app-tailscale-community/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/tailscale.js:194
